WEBVTT

00:00:21.501 --> 00:00:24.591
[GOAL BELL RINGS]

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:26.636
Another goal
for Slytherin!

00:00:28.943 --> 00:00:31.163
They lead Gryffindor 90 to 30.

00:00:33.339 --> 00:00:35.732
Yeah!

00:00:35.732 --> 00:00:37.212
Yeah!

00:01:01.236 --> 00:01:02.847
All right there, Scarhead?

00:01:09.679 --> 00:01:11.333
Watch yourself, Harry.

00:01:12.508 --> 00:01:14.554
Wood, look out!

00:01:27.045 --> 00:01:30.962
Blimey! Harry's got himself
a rogue Bludger.

00:01:30.962 --> 00:01:33.051
That's been tampered with,
that has.

00:01:33.051 --> 00:01:35.140
I'll stop it.

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:37.751
No. Even with a proper wand,
it's too risky.

00:01:37.751 --> 00:01:39.579
You could hit Harry.

00:02:04.821 --> 00:02:06.606
Training for the ballet, Potter?

00:02:38.507 --> 00:02:40.945
You'll never catch me, Potter!

